<programme channel="DocuBox.HD.fr" start="20261004193000 +0000" stop="20261004195500 +0000">
    <title lang="fr">Les nouvelles frontières de l'espace</title>
    <sub-title lang="fr">Des lanceurs pour l'espace</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">Launching payloads into space is a very difficult task, historically rocket launches are the proverbial "swords into ploughshares" Missiles designed to carry atomic warheads now send satellites and probes into the solar system. Ironically it's one of the few exploits Mankind undertakes that doesn't occur in nature.</desc>
