<programme channel="CA400004SM" start="20261004160846 +0000" stop="20261004185203 +0000">
    <title>Eric Clapton &amp; Steve Winwood</title>
    <sub-title>Eric Clapton &amp; Steve Winwood - Live from MSG</sub-title>
    <desc>History rocked and rock made history during a sold-out three-gig stand at Madison Square Garden in late February 2008 when icons Eric Clapton and Steve Winwood performed a concert together for the first time since their all-too-brief days in the legendary Blind Faith in 1969. Whether they will ever team again is unknown. But with Eric Clapton and Steve Winwood Live From Madison Square Garden fans everywhere are able to experience the sound and the glory of a performance on that famous stage by two of rock's greatest artists.</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/CA_USQT620324A_537803390_0_20240131T112250287Z_51.jpeg" />
