<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261004045115 +0000" stop="20261004054917 +0000">
    <title>The Ship Sinkers</title>
    <desc>What fate awaits ships that were once proud vessels at bay, but have now turned into floating junkyards? While one option is to cut them up for scrap, another alternative is to use them to bolster marine biodiversity by turning them into artificial reefs. The old naval ships are sunk to an underwater resting place by ship sinkers.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261004054917 +0000" stop="20261004060000 +0000">
    <title>Bright Now S1 - "Saving Venice"</title>
    <desc>MOSE is one of the largest and highest-profile civil-engineering works. But will it be able to save Venice? Venice has grappled with inundation for centuries.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261004060000 +0000" stop="20261004070555 +0000">
    <title>Wild And Alive S1 - "Place of Hope"</title>
    <desc>The seasons at De Hoop Nature Reserve drive a remarkable recovery for five iconic species, from the arrival of whales to the intense Bontebok rut.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261004070555 +0000" stop="20261004080817 +0000">
    <title>Wild And Alive S1 - "Giant's Migration"</title>
    <desc>Mammoth mammals migrate from the Antarctic to South Africa's coast to mate and give birth, featuring aerial displays and massive feeding frenzies.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261004080817 +0000" stop="20261004091210 +0000">
    <title>Wild And Alive S1 - "Rhino Rescue Cote d’Ivoire"</title>
    <desc>Willem Burger faces a career-defining mission to relocate the Ivory Coast’s last white rhino after a tragic encounter with a local village chief.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261004091210 +0000" stop="20261004101632 +0000">
    <title>Wild And Alive S1 - "The Season’s Feast"</title>
    <desc>As the savanna turns lush, Africa’s most elusive creatures emerge to cash in on the seasonal abundance in a relentless, high-stakes quest to feed.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261004101632 +0000" stop="20261004104955 +0000">
    <title>Orphans of the Wild S1 - "Painted Pubs"</title>
    <desc>Fourteen higly endangered Wild Dog pups arrive at Naankuse, Marlice, with the help of Zacheo meets this challenge head-on - in the meantime the leopard cubs are beginning to pose a danger to Zacheo.</desc>
  </programme>
  
